{"id":"wb-7-1166","name":"凤台寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"凤台寺塔","text":"凤台寺塔位于中国河南省新郑市城关乡，1986年被列为第二批河南省文物保护单位，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n凤台寺早已被毁，现仅存塔。塔建于北宋元丰四年（1081年）以前，为密檐式砖塔，空心，平面呈六角形，共九层，高19.1米。第一层塔身较高，东面辟门，塔内壁凹砌踏龛，可登至第八层。“塔寺晚钟”是新郑古代八景之一。\n2018年当地政府重修。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%87%A4%E5%8F%B0%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":93805518,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93805518","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/039b3fc4444ab826c339cbf3.jpg","title":"20231118_Pagoda_of_Fengtai_Temple_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20231118_Pagoda_of_Fengtai_Temple_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/20231118_Pagoda_of_Fengtai_Temple_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Pagoda of Fengtai Temple","width":320,"height":480}}